/* ── Rich Text Editor node ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 *
 * A WYSIWYG rich-text editor built on the vendored TipTap bundle above
 * (global `NodeGXTipTap`: Editor, StarterKit, Placeholder). Fully client-side,
 * no network, no CDN. Follows the qr-code module pattern: the node is a React
 * node created with the SDK shim's `Noodl.defineReactNode`.
 *
 * Inputs:  HTML (set content), Placeholder, Editable
 * Outputs: HTML, Text, Changed (signal — fires on every user edit)
 * Toolbar: bold, italic, H1–H3, bullet list, ordered list, link, undo, redo.
 * All chrome colours are design tokens (var(--…)) so the editor follows the
 * app's theme; nothing is hardcoded.
 */
